  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e221a66a5e0b02845bae96e3770be3b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AIAdventure.Level.Note
  title: "Kaz\u0131 G\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC \u2014 3. G\xFCn"
  body: "Haritadaki i\u015Faret do\u011Fruymu\u015F. Tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131n alt\u0131nda, merdivenlerin bitti\u011Fi yerde eski bir mahzen var. K\xF6yl\xFCler buraya \"Talih Tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131\" diyor ve kimse yakla\u015Fm\u0131yor.\n\nGarip olan \u015Fu: duvarlardaki me\u015Faleler biz gelmeden \xF6nce de yan\u0131yordu. Kerem bunun birinin \u015Fakas\u0131 oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Ben o kadar emin de\u011Filim.\n\n\u2014 Dr. Leyla Aras"
